{title: Humko Man Ki Shakti Dena}
{artist: Guddi Vani Jairam Vasant Desai}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] [G] [D],        Hum ko man kee shakti dienaa,
[D] [G],        Man vijay kare
[D] [G],        Dusaron kee jay se pahale,
[D] [G] [A] [D],        Khud ko jay kare
[D] [G] [D],        Bhedabhaaw apane Dil se
[G] [A] [D],        Saaf kar sake
[D] [G] [D],        Doston se bhool ho To
[G] [A] [D],        Maaf kar sake
[D] [G] [D],        Zoothh se bache rahe,
[D] [G],        Sach kaa dam bhare
[D] [G],        Dusaron kee jay se pahale,
[D] [G] [A] [D],        Khud ko jay kare
[D] [G] [D],        Mushkile pade to hum Pe
[G] [A] [D],        Itanaa karam kar
[D] [G] [D],        Saath de to dharam kaa,
[G] [A] [D],        Chale to dharam kar
[D] [G] [D],        Khud pe hausalaa rahe,
[D] [G],        Badee se naa dare
[D] [G],        Dusaron kee jay se pahale,
[D] [G] [A] [D],        Khud ko jay kare
